# Firebase Configuration (get from Firebase Console)
# These values are configured directly in index.html as they are public client-side keys
# See AI_PROJECT_GUIDE.md for setup instructions

# IMPORTANT: Firebase App Check uses reCAPTCHA Enterprise
# Configure your domain in Firebase Console > App Check
# Add your Vercel domain to authorized domains in Firebase Console > Authentication

# Gemini AI is accessed via Firebase AI Logic (no separate API key needed)
# Firebase AI Logic uses App Check for security

# Optional: For local development
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
